			"hadithnumber": 3445,
			"arabicnumber": 3445,
			"text": "It was narrated that ‘Aishah said:“If any of his family members became ill, the Messenger of Allah (ﷺ) would order that some broth be made. And he would say: ‘It consoles the grieving heart and cleanses the ailing heart, as anyone of you cleanses her face of dirt with water.’”",
